      (∀ z, ∀ φ ∈ GlobalTheory.WeilM.SB (κ → k), ι (GlobalTheory.WeilM.schr ψ0 (wM z) φ) = fun Y' => ψ0 (∑ i, ∑ j, Y' i j * z i j) * ι φ Y') := by
